        },
        "image_with_text_TeaNEx": {
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "desc": "<p><em><strong>“Told the pill was your only option?”</strong></em></p>",
            "desc2": "<p>Many women are offered quick fixes, like the pill, that mask symptoms and come with side effects instead of supporting full cycle health. monthlies is designed to balance your body across your whole cycle, so changes build over time.</p>"
          }
        },
        "guarantee_block_zm7BR7": {
          "settings": {
            "guarantee_text": "Try it for 90 days. If you don’t feel a difference, you don’t pay.",
            "guarantee_link_text": "Information"
          }
        },
        "review_quote_block_YDW7mc": {
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "review_quote": "<strong>“Another mum in our school group recommended this, and it´s the first thing that has actually helped”</strong>",
            "review_author": "<strong>- Emma, mum of a 15-year-old. </strong>",
            "sub_review_text": "+ Thousands of women trust monthlies",
            "review_photo_1": "shopify://shop_images/b4rpqhgtu7vjr1ahcabx_e28f1961-b207-465f-b4a7-9cdb04734c62.webp",
            "review_photo_4": "shopify://shop_images/Background_f72df9d7-8967-4060-82ad-91390a666b7d.png"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_DBKUPd": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Your cycle is more than just your period. It influences how you sleep, how you eat, your mood, your performance, and the energy you wake up with. So when things feel “off”, it’s rarely just one thing. It’s your body trying to tell you it needs support.</p><p>Many women experience period pain and menstrual symptoms because of the pain triangle -<strong> hormonal imbalance, increased prostaglandins, and nutrient gaps</strong> that quietly build up over time.This is often why symptoms return month after month.</p><p>This is where monthlies truly stands apart.</p><p>Our daily formula brings together 26 vitamins, minerals and plant extracts, that help support hormonal balance, regulate prostaglandin production, and replenish nutrient stores your body relies on throughout the month.</p><p>The result is a gentle, sustainable approach that helps you feel more supported throughout your cycle.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_9T4drG": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>We’ve created monthlies to be a no-nonsense formula, with every ingredient chosen for a clear purpose. Our formula brings together extensively studied vitamins, minerals, nutrients and plant extracts that are backed by scientific research. Each ingredient contributes to a specific function that helps your body feel supported throughout the month.</p><p></p><ul><li><strong>Support steady energy levels:</strong> Magnesium, B vitamins and iron aid normal energy production and help reduce fatigue*.</li><li>Anise seed and flax seed are trusted and traditionally used to promote healthier digestion*.</li><li><strong>Maintain healthy blood sugar levels:</strong> Chromium contributes to the maintenance of normal blood glucose levels.</li><li><strong>Support hair, skin and nails:</strong> Vitamin A, vitamin C, biotin and zinc support healthy skin, hair and nail function*.</li><li><strong>Support immune resilience:</strong> Vitamin C, selenium and zinc contribute to the normal function of the immune system*.</li><li>Ginger and turmeric contain active compounds that may support the health of joints and bones*.</li><li>Antioxidants: Lemon balm and flaxseed may possess antioxidant properties*</li></ul><p>If you'd like to explore every ingredient, how it works and why we chose it, you can find the full breakdown here: <a href=\"https://shop.withmonthlies.com/pages/all-ingredients\" target=\"_blank\">All 26 Ingredients</a></p>"
          }
        }
      }
    },
