      "settings": {},
      "blocks": {
        "faq_ayjtAN": {
          "settings": {
            "faq_text": "<p>We design every product with female health experts, using research-driven formulation to meet your unique needs. Our approach prioritises  effectiveness, and innovation.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_qCHMa8": {
          "settings": {
            "faq_text": "<p>Proudly manufactured in the UK, in a GMP-certified facility, and third-party tested for purity. Every step reflects our commitment to excellence and transparency.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_8jtp9e": {
          "settings": {
            "faq_text": "<p>Our formulation uses highly bioavailable, pre-activated nutrient forms that your body absorbs easily. Many vitamins and minerals must be converted into their active forms before the body can use them - a process that can be inefficient for many people. By using pre-activated forms, we bypass this step, improve absorption, and ensure more of each nutrient actually reaches where it’s needed.</p><p>This results in:</p><ul><li>better effectiveness, because more active nutrients reach your bloodstream and tissues.</li><li>faster results, as optimally absorbed nutrients begin working sooner.</li><li>highly absorbable forms</li><li>ideal for sensitive individuals.</li></ul><p>Everything we include is chosen with intention for the best tolerance, maximum effectiveness, and meaningful support for your body.</p>"
          }
        },
